      "text": "Alma1 high priest, Mosiah 23:16 (26:7). Alma2 consecrated high priest by father, Alma 4:4. Alma2 retains office of high priest, Alma 4:18. high priests ordained unto high priesthood after order of the Son, Alma 13:1–11. Ammon2 high priest over Ammonites, Alma 30:20. Helaman2 and his brethren are high priests over Church, Alma 46:6. they who had been high priests are angry with men who preach against sins of people, 3 Ne. 6:20–21.",
